{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/OF24zx.png?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>7 different games</strong> inspired by cult horror movies from the 80's and 90's. That exaggerated horror in some cases even comical and disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some games are more horror and tension oriented, others are based on bullshit movies like (Scary Movie).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each game has its own particularity, making them unique! Embark on various adventures and take a dive back to the 80s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What games come in this collection?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1873</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/1873B.gif?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;1873&quot;</strong> is a horror and investigation game, with elements of armed combat. Using the vibe of the 1800s.\u00a0For those who are used to my games, this one has a very different style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/dad.png?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;DAD&quot;</strong> is a horror game with a bizarre style and story. Inspired by horror and suspense films from the 80s and 90s. With PS1 style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fart Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/fart1.gif?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Fart Killer&quot;</strong> is a short trash comedy game mixed with cult horror from the 80s. With totally absurd and meaningless scenes. Don't expect a super Hollywood production...\u00a0It's much better than that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gears 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/GEAR2A.gif?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Gears 2&quot;</strong> is a psychological survival horror game. Inspired by the movies &quot;SAW&quot;. Bringing different mechanics from the first game.\u00a0Bringing tense moments with a lot of gore... forcing you to make decisions that will lead to life or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Halloween Revenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/h02.gif?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Halloween Revenge&quot;</strong> is a short horror game inspired by trash horror movies from the 80s.\u00a0Mixing weird horror with comedy and weird characters. This mix results in a nostalgic game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trash Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/TRASH02.gif?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Trash Night&quot;</strong> is a horror and drama game inspired by the cult horror films of the 80s and 90s... The golden age of VHS tapes.\u00a0With &quot;PS1&quot; style graphics and an environment reminiscent of low-budget films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>We Are not Alone - Contact</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/0011.gif?t=1741285902\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;We Are Not Alone - Contact&quot;</strong> is a reimagining of the first game. Inspired by alien horror films from the 80s, bringing comical horror and at the same time scary and bloody.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/AwZ5dw.png?t=1741285902\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569980?t=1741285902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569980?t=1741285902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/2e9e055a1ac3013ec99b61b32f8de9344503f2a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741285902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/2e9e055a1ac3013ec99b61b32f8de9344503f2a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741285902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depictions of sexual acts and/or extreme violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569980/extras/OF24zx.png?t=1741285902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are <strong>7 different games</strong> inspired by cult horror movies from the 80's and 90's. That exaggerated horror in some cases even comical and disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some games are more horror and tension oriented, others are based on bullshit movies like (Scary Movie).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each game has its own particularity, making them unique! Embark on various adventures and take a dive b